# Grading and Assessment

=== layout: one-panel

# *Assignments, Quizzes, and Exams*

@body

- [*Assignments*]{color=red}\: reinforce learning; explore new topics
  - Weekly; 5-15 points; unlimited retakes
  - Collaboration and help encouraged
- [*Quizzes*]{color=red}\: recent material
  - Individual\: 20 points; 30 minutes
  - Group quiz during class
- [*Exams*]{color=red}\: cumulative midterm and final
  - Individual; 100 points total
  - Each part\: 50 points; 75 minutes

=== layout: two-panels

# *Graded vs Total Percentage*

@left

- *Graded percentage* includes only items with a recorded grade.
- Excludes items that have not been graded, including unfinished assignments.
- More useful when *Dr. Voss* still has submitted work to grade.

@right

- *Total percentage* includes all items counted toward your Blackboard grade.
- Counts items without a recorded grade as zero.
  - This includes submitted work waiting to be graded.
- More useful for seeing the effect of assignments you have not attempted.

